As long as we guide each other, we got the world spinning right in our hands.

7
00:00:26,660 --> 00:00:29,980
Baby, you and me, we gotta be good friends.

8
00:00:29,980 --> 00:00:39,420
The luckiest dreamers who never quit dreaming As long as we keep on giving We can

9
