Oh, I'm sorry.

18
00:01:29,960 --> 00:01:32,060
Oh, I love Saturday mornings, so tranquil.

19
00:01:32,760 --> 00:01:35,660
You know, if you listen carefully, you can almost hear the leaves fall.

20
00:01:40,360 --> 00:01:41,380
Big leaves this year.

21
