You scuzz ball!

22
00:01:43,920 --> 00:01:45,200
You're the scuzz ball!

23
00:01:45,280 --> 00:01:46,900
You're mama! You're mama!

24
00:01:46,900 --> 00:01:49,320
Hey, wait, kids, kids, kids.

25
00:01:49,440 --> 00:01:50,840
You both have the same mama.

26
00:01:52,520 --> 00:01:53,960
Uh, what's this all about?

27
00:01:54,400 --> 00:01:56,080
Carol turned the water off.

28
00:01:56,120 --> 00:01:59,000
I was taking a shower and she turned the water off.

29
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:00,500
I had to.

30
00:02:00,540 --> 00:02:01,980
He wouldn't let me in the bathroom.

31
00:02:02,140 --> 00:02:03,740
I was indisposed.

32
00:02:05,860 --> 00:02:08,820
He was in there for an hour and a half.

33
00:02:09,620 --> 00:02:12,120
One hour, 33 minutes, and 22 seconds.

34
00:02:13,960 --> 00:02:16,460
He's trying to get into the world record book.

35
00:02:16,720 --> 00:02:17,760
As what, Ben?

36
00:02:17,900 --> 00:02:18,940
The human prune?

37
00:02:21,680 --> 00:02:23,600
No, for taking the longest shower.

38
00:02:23,680 --> 00:02:25,880
The record's only 374 hours.

39
00:02:25,880 --> 00:02:27,080
I can beat that easy.

40
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:31,200
Ben, 300, that's two weeks.

41
00:02:31,280 --> 00:02:32,960
You can't stay in the water that long.

42
