That's what they told Jacques Cousteau.

43
00:02:37,240 --> 00:02:38,860
Ben, Jacques had a submarine.

44
00:02:39,200 --> 00:02:40,480
Not when he was nine.

45
00:02:41,860 --> 00:02:45,340
Ben? Right. I wanted to be immortal.

46
00:02:45,480 --> 00:02:47,140
Instead, I'm just wet.

47
