Hey, quick, hide the chimney.

58
00:03:30,440 --> 00:03:31,860
Come on, Dad, I'm serious.

59
00:03:32,740 --> 00:03:34,160
The first class starts today.

60
00:03:34,840 --> 00:03:38,040
Mike, why are you so hot all of a sudden about taking karate?

61
00:03:38,320 --> 00:03:39,060
Can you believe that?

62
00:03:39,080 --> 00:03:41,040
Dad, she wants to know why I want to take karate.

63
00:03:42,080 --> 00:03:43,320
Mike? Yeah, Dad?

64
00:03:43,360 --> 00:03:44,580
Why do you want to take karate?

65
00:03:45,940 --> 00:03:47,240
No, I just want to.

66
00:03:48,080 --> 00:03:49,960
The analytical mind at work.

67
00:03:50,360 --> 00:03:52,120
Come on, Dad, does everybody have to have a reason to do it?

68
00:03:52,120 --> 00:03:53,580
Is there a reason for everything they do?

69
00:03:53,680 --> 00:03:55,660
No. Well, there you go, then.

70
00:03:55,740 --> 00:03:56,640
So you'll pay for the lessons?

71
00:03:56,980 --> 00:03:59,240
No. Why not?

72
00:03:59,340 --> 00:04:06,700
No reason. Mike, I think I speak for both your father and myself when I ask you.

73
00:04:07,480 --> 00:04:09,460
Is there a girl in this class?

74
