What are you guys talking about?

77
00:04:23,780 --> 00:04:26,720
Remember when you just had to take horseback riding lessons?

78
00:04:27,120 --> 00:04:30,460
Yeah, because you said it would help you overcome your fear of large animals.

79
00:04:32,460 --> 00:04:36,080
Yeah, you got to admit, Debbie DeZamba was large.

80
00:04:38,100 --> 00:04:42,000
Right. Remember when you just had to learn Scottish folk dancing?

81
00:04:42,860 --> 00:04:44,760
Yeah, I was starved for culture.

82
00:04:46,440 --> 00:04:47,520
This is different, Dad.

83
00:04:47,520 --> 00:04:48,200
This is karate.

84
00:04:48,200 --> 00:04:50,820
It's a man's sport, and it costs next to nothing.

85
00:04:50,960 --> 00:04:52,080
Oh, good, good.

86
00:04:52,640 --> 00:04:53,980
You get change for a dollar?

87
00:04:55,480 --> 00:04:57,180
Okay, how next to nothing?

88
