It's only $125, Dad.

89
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:03,260
And that includes a dozen training bricks.

90
00:05:06,360 --> 00:05:08,260
Mike, here's $10.

91
00:05:08,940 --> 00:05:10,260
Go buy her a burger.

92
00:05:10,420 --> 00:05:16,980
It's cheaper. Brought you some coffee.

93
00:05:16,980 --> 00:05:18,440
Oh, hi. Oh, not there.

94
00:05:18,440 --> 00:05:20,000
No, no. Would you get me a coaster there, please?

95
00:05:21,820 --> 00:05:24,860
