96
00:05:25,120 --> 00:05:27,620
Uh -huh. And now you're just keeping it warm?

97
00:05:30,020 --> 00:05:32,720
Ah, what are you doing, Jason, that you don't want me to see?

98
00:05:32,860 --> 00:05:33,920
