for? 42. Bingo!

132
00:07:17,220 --> 00:07:20,040
Yeah, Boner. Yeah, look, remember when we saw the karate kid?

133
00:07:20,860 --> 00:07:24,840
Yeah. Okay, well, what did the old man tell the kid was the most important reason to

134
